# Plan 状态机

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> generated: persist new plan
    generated --> active: first task starts
    generated --> archived: replaced / user archives
    active --> completed: all plan tasks completed
    active --> archived: successful replan replaces it
    completed --> archived: retention / user archives
    archived --> [*]
```

`adopted_at` 在 generated→active 时写入，不再把 adopted 设计成独立状态。
